+# CGPA Calculator
+
+Open it from **Analytics tab > CGPA Calculator**. It works for any college: no ERP login, account or academic setup needed. Inputs are saved on the phone only.
+
+## Three modes
+- **By subjects**: semesters with subjects (credits + grade). SGPA per semester and CGPA overall = sum(credit x grade point) / sum(credits).
+- **From SGPAs**: type each semester's published SGPA (+ credits for a credit-weighted CGPA). Without credits it is a plain average and says so.
+- **Target**: current CGPA, credits done, credits left, target -> the average grade point you need (and the closest grade). Says "not reachable" with the best possible CGPA when it is impossible.
+
+## Nothing is assumed about your university
+Grade scale (presets are examples, fully editable), rounding (half up / half even / cut off), decimal places, "round each SGPA first", whether a row counts toward GPA, and the CGPA-to-percentage factor are all settings. No factor = no percentage is shown.
+Incomplete or invalid rows are listed with the reason and are NOT counted; they are never dropped silently.
+
+## Files
+`domain/CgpaCalculator.kt` (maths), `domain/CgpaUiModel.kt` (state to results), `data/preferences/CgpaStore.kt`, `ui/CgpaViewModel.kt`, `ui/screens/CgpaCalculatorScreen.kt`, hook in `DashboardScreen.kt`.
+
+## Tests
+`CgpaCalculatorTest` (17) + `CgpaEvaluatorTest` (9): 26 passed on a JVM with the Kotlin 2.2.10 compiler. Includes exact-tie rounding (8.125 -> 8.13 / 8.12 / 8.12), a real case where rounding SGPA first changes the CGPA, and unreachable/secured targets.
+
+## Not verified
+The Compose screen, SharedPreferences storage and the dashboard hook were never compiled or run (no Android SDK here). Please build, then check: add 2 semesters, switch tabs, rotate the phone, kill and reopen the app (inputs persist), 200% font size, TalkBack reads the row delete buttons.
